    "Name": "Rotunda C Spycar",
    "Details": "This variant of the Rotunda C replaces the four ER Small Lasers with a lower tech armament of two Clan Machine Guns and a Rocket Launcher 10 in the front, and adds a Mine Dispenser in the rear. Its extra-light engine was upgraded to a higher rating, which lets it outrun nearly all civilian traffic. Like every Rotunda C it relies on interchangeable body kits, so its exterior says nothing about which variant an observer is facing.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 14/21 hexes / 420/630 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       100      5\n<b>Left</b>          80      5\n<b>Right</b>        80      5\n<b>Rear</b>         75      5\n\n<b>Total</b>      335     20</color>",
